WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Going against the current usually lasts four to six minutes

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,050
A person is in the water for three minutes

3
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:08,050
We will have someone pull Miss Qin up.

4
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:11,650
This is the performance fee of one million Mr. Du

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,580
I know someone who is perfect for this show

6
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:17,780
He loves money very much. His name is Jian Tong from the public relations department.

7
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,340
For money, he can lie on the ground and learn to crawl like a dog.

8
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,540
Wagging the tail to pick up money

9
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:22,940
The whole Donghuang knows it

10
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,940
Mr. Du wants to see an exciting performance

11
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,940
Just look for him

12
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,140
Pull tight

13
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:36,930
A Biao went to invite Tai Chou

14
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,530
Sir, don’t just look at appearances.

15
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:41,930
Sister Jian Tong, he can definitely perform well for two million dollars

16
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:46,430
You invest two million players with me

17
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:49,030
I risked my life to accept this performance

18
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,630
I will perform my best

19
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,820
My life is more than two million

20
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,950
But Mr. Du felt happy when he saw the performance

21
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:56,950
worth two million
